flowchart TD
    CASES[Freeze 32 synthetic labeled cases: eight per agent] --> SPLIT[Separate model context from expected labels]
    SPLIT --> BASE[Run local role baseline]
    SPLIT --> LIVE[Run production invoke_agent prompts, schemas and guards]
    CONFIG[Record model, prompt, dataset and grader fingerprints] --> LIVE
    LIVE --> BUDGET[Use shared cumulative ledger and smaller eval run cap]
    BASE --> GRADE[Deterministic graders compare outputs with hidden expected labels]
    BUDGET --> GRADE
    GRADE --> METRICS[Per-agent contract validity and task pass rates]
    GRADE --> DIAG[Quality metrics, latency, cost and repeat stability]
    METRICS --> GATE{Each live agent: contract 100 percent and task pass at least 90 percent?}
    GATE -->|Yes| PASS[Successful evaluation exit]
    GATE -->|No| FAIL[Nonzero exit with failures preserved]
    PASS --> REPORT[Versioned run folder: journal, cases, metadata, JSON, CSV and HTML]
    FAIL --> REPORT
    DIAG --> REPORT
    REPORT --> TEAM[Team review and capstone evidence]
    REPORT --> APP[How it works evaluation scorecards]
    NEW[Phase 2: 20 tool, grounding and permutation cases] --> GRADE
    JOURNEY[Seven synthetic journeys: full, local and one-role-disabled variants] --> TEAM
